1529
00:52:49,573 --> 00:52:50,798
- [Tom Sirvo] No there's not.

1530
00:52:50,798 --> 00:52:52,343
- And not shooting him down in cold blood.

1531
00:52:52,343 --> 00:52:53,794
- They shouldn't have resisted arrested.

1532
00:52:53,794 --> 00:52:55,064
- Resist arrest?

1533
00:52:55,064 --> 00:52:57,242
That's just an excuse to legalize murder.

1534
00:52:57,242 --> 00:52:59,104
Pete Ferguson didn't
even have a gun on him

1535
00:52:59,104 --> 00:53:00,702
when he resisted arrest.

1536
00:53:00,702 --> 00:53:02,386
- Just the same, there
were Double C horses

1537
00:53:02,386 --> 00:53:04,076
