1538
00:53:04,076 --> 00:53:06,381
- I still say a man is innocent
until he's proven guilty.

1539
00:53:06,381 --> 00:53:07,589
- [Tom Sirvo] You would think that.

1540
00:53:07,589 --> 00:53:08,725
- Call off your deputies.

1541
00:53:08,725 --> 00:53:09,726
- [Croooow] Take back your mink

1542
00:53:09,726 --> 00:53:12,484
- [Duke] We can settle
this some other way.

1543
00:53:12,484 --> 00:53:14,962
- I didn't start this thing Barnum,

1544
00:53:14,962 --> 00:53:18,174
but now that it's started,
I'm going to finish it.

1545
00:53:18,174 --> 00:53:19,530
- [Tom Sirvo] Oh where's the magic

1546
00:53:19,530 --> 00:53:21,267
of that cowboy meeting, damn.

1547
00:53:21,267 --> 00:53:22,954
- Is that final?

1548
00:53:22,954 --> 00:53:23,999
- That's final.

1549
00:53:23,999 --> 00:53:25,398
- [Tom Sirvo] Double dog final.

1550
00:53:25,398 --> 00:53:26,876
- Up 'til now there's been
nothing personal about this

1551
00:53:26,876 --> 00:53:27,793
on my part.

1552
00:53:29,734 --> 00:53:31,351
Here on in, it's gonna be different.

1553
00:53:31,351 --> 00:53:33,119
- [Croooow] I'm gonna make
fun of your condition.

1554
00:53:33,119 --> 00:53:35,678
- Threats don't scare me any.

1555
00:53:35,678 --> 00:53:38,876
See that he gets off the
range without being bothered,

1556
00:53:38,876 --> 00:53:43,666
