1559
00:53:48,271 --> 00:53:52,365
(sweet orchestral music)

1560
00:53:52,365 --> 00:53:54,727
- [Croooow] Quit dobbing
your neck on my property.

1561
00:53:54,727 --> 00:53:56,114
- [Tom Sirvo] Boy my
ears have been dripping

1562
