1565
00:54:02,883 --> 00:54:05,757
(sweet orchestral music)

1566
00:54:05,757 --> 00:54:07,871
- [Tom Sirvo] Let's have a
merchant ivory sort of picnic,

1567
00:54:07,871 --> 00:54:09,590
