1570
00:54:12,772 --> 00:54:16,189
(sweet orchestral music)

1571
00:54:17,718 --> 00:54:19,249
- [Croooow] Could you
uh, pretend I'm not here

1572
00:54:19,249 --> 00:54:20,668
