1576
00:54:25,782 --> 00:54:26,862
- I know you are.

1577
00:54:26,862 --> 00:54:28,583
- But he's wrong and he's got to be shown.

1578
00:54:28,583 --> 00:54:30,503
- He's all I have in the world,

1579
00:54:30,503 --> 00:54:32,810
