- [Croooow] You're evil because of it.

1582
00:54:35,403 --> 00:54:36,720
- That's why I wanted it to be different.

1583
00:54:36,720 --> 00:54:38,101
- [Mike] Hey this feels good tighter.

1584
00:54:38,101 --> 00:54:39,326
- Sometimes things don't work out

1585
