1592
00:54:50,460 --> 00:54:53,293
- [Croooow] Oh it's cowboy poetry.

1593
00:54:54,391 --> 00:54:55,983
- [Mike] Oh eta Annie.

1594
00:54:55,983 --> 00:54:59,214
- I guess I've said more
than I should've already.

1595
00:54:59,214 --> 00:55:01,298
- No you haven't Duke.

1596
00:55:01,298 --> 00:55:02,857
- [Croooow] Touch my gingham!

1597
00:55:02,857 --> 00:55:04,281
- Please go on.

1598
00:55:04,281 --> 00:55:07,203
(sweet orchestral music)

1599
00:55:07,203 --> 00:55:11,928
- [Croooow] You give me
that nude head of yours.

1600
00:55:11,928 --> 00:55:16,063
- [Tom Sirvo] No I can't
be untrue to Remedy.

1601
00:55:16,063 --> 00:55:18,429
- [Croooow] So that's it
for my whole life, huh?

1602
00:55:18,429 --> 00:55:20,006
- [Tom Sirvo] Yep.

1603
00:55:20,006 --> 00:55:21,664
Meanwhile the bandana's out there

1604
00:55:21,664 --> 00:55:23,331
