1607
00:55:29,333 --> 00:55:30,553
- [Tom Sirvo] Did you know that?

1608
00:55:30,553 --> 00:55:31,617
- [Mike] I didn't know.

1609
00:55:31,617 --> 00:55:32,589
- [Tom Sirvo] Shut up.

1610
00:55:32,589 --> 00:55:33,755
- [Croooow] So are you up for some limbo?

1611
00:55:33,755 --> 00:55:34,838
Limbo rah ha!

1612
00:55:37,248 --> 00:55:40,121
Uh, I wouldn't touch that.

1613
00:55:40,121 --> 00:55:43,902
- [Tom Sirvo] Only one man
has this sweaty a neck.

1614
00:55:43,902 --> 00:55:45,296
- [Croooow] This movie
should've been called

1615
00:55:45,296 --> 00:55:47,050
Lost and Found.

1616
00:55:47,050 --> 00:55:48,750
What a luck, you found a hankie,

1617
00:55:48,750 --> 00:55:50,723
