1619
00:55:52,260 --> 00:55:54,897
- [Tom Sirvo] Oh Zig Ziggler's in town.

1620
00:55:54,897 --> 00:55:57,098
- Hit the Miller ranch.

1621
00:55:57,098 --> 00:55:59,525
