prove him otherwise.

1624
00:56:04,961 --> 00:56:08,088
Go pick up Rocky, he's waiting
for you over at the office.

1625
00:56:08,088 --> 00:56:09,827
- [Croooow] From zero to one in...

1626
00:56:09,827 --> 00:56:11,742
(mumbles)

1627
