1637
00:56:27,933 --> 00:56:28,766
Jane?

1638
00:56:29,611 --> 00:56:32,194
- [Mike] Bring boy and cheetah.

1639
00:56:33,112 --> 00:56:34,328
- Jane?

1640
00:56:34,328 --> 00:56:35,775
- [Tom Sirvo] Jane has you surrounded.

1641
00:56:35,775 --> 00:56:37,253
- [Croooow] Uh just as we planned,

1642
00:56:37,253 --> 00:56:40,007
Jane doesn't come when I call.

1643
00:56:40,007 --> 00:56:41,369
- Jane?

1644
00:56:41,369 --> 00:56:44,298
- [Croooow] Oh, could you get that for me?

1645
00:56:44,298 --> 00:56:46,237
What I mean is I support your plan,

1646
00:56:46,237 --> 00:56:47,787
I wish it many successes.

1647
00:56:47,787 --> 00:56:50,337
- Why take it to have it pinned on us.

1648
00:56:50,337 --> 00:56:51,772
- [Mr. Cooper] Jane!

1649
00:56:51,772 --> 00:56:53,051
(suspenseful music)

1650
00:56:53,051 --> 00:56:54,079
Jane!

1651
00:56:54,079 --> 00:56:56,600
- [Croooow] Stop this crazy thing!

1652
00:56:56,600 --> 00:56:59,350
- [Tom Sirvo] Oh never mind Jane!

1653
00:57:01,485 --> 00:57:03,255
- You like the Coopers, don't you?

1654
00:57:03,255 --> 00:57:05,522
- [Croooow] Don't you? Dukey
likes his Coopers, doesn't he?

1655
00:57:05,522 --> 00:57:06,772
- She's pretty.

1656
00:57:07,786 --> 00:57:10,869
- So are you, in a girly sort of way.

1657
00:57:12,030 --> 00:57:15,105
- I'm not a girl, I'm
a woman, a grown woman.

1658
00:57:15,105 --> 00:57:16,202
- [Tom Sirvo] I'll say.

1659
00:57:16,202 --> 00:57:17,322
- What's the matter with you chipmunks?

1660
00:57:17,322 --> 00:57:18,261
- Well he...

1661
00:57:18,261 --> 00:57:19,683
That is I...

1662
00:57:19,683 --> 00:57:20,766
Oh nevermind.

1663
00:57:23,141 --> 00:57:25,130
- [Croooow] Well this
moradic acid will be safe,

1664
00:57:25,130 --> 00:57:26,515
oh no!

1665
00:57:26,515 --> 00:57:29,091
- Why don't you watch where you're going?

1666
00:57:29,091 --> 00:57:31,206
- [Tom Sirvo] Uh darn, I've
been saving my own filth

1667
00:57:31,206 --> 00:57:34,012
