have to start over again.

1668
00:57:34,012 --> 00:57:35,762
Better get to it pal.

1669
00:57:36,971 --> 00:57:38,599
- I know it won't do any good, but someday

1670
00:57:38,599 --> 00:57:41,416
I'm gonna take a course
in female psychology.

1671
00:57:41,416 --> 00:57:43,417
- [Croooow] May even become a female.

1672
00:57:43,417 --> 00:57:46,079
(sweet orchestral music)

1673
00:57:46,079 --> 00:57:47,737
- [Tom Sirvo] Well dad,
doesn't your anxiety

1674
00:57:47,737 --> 00:57:51,109
