1680
00:58:02,316 --> 00:58:04,405
Looks like you got some color dad.

1681
00:58:04,405 --> 00:58:06,957
(sweet orchestral music)

1682
00:58:06,957 --> 00:58:08,162
- [Tom Sirvo] All right hot wheels,

1683
00:58:08,162 --> 00:58:09,495
