1684
00:58:14,802 --> 00:58:16,192
- [Croooow] Well no time to talk dad,

1685
00:58:16,192 --> 00:58:17,556
I'm going straight upstairs.

1686
00:58:17,556 --> 00:58:19,185
I have a lot of things to do today.

1687
00:58:19,185 --> 00:58:20,605
- Dad, I wanna talk to you.

1688
00:58:20,605 --> 00:58:22,630
- [Tom Sirvo] And don't say
I word 'til I'm finished.

1689
00:58:22,630 --> 00:58:24,208
- Dad.

1690
00:58:24,208 --> 00:58:25,687
- [Mike] Daddy?

1691
00:58:25,687 --> 00:58:27,242
- [Tom Sirvo] Dad?

1692
00:58:27,242 --> 00:58:29,571
(somber orchestral music)

1693
00:58:29,571 --> 00:58:31,065
- [Croooow] Oh good one dad.

1694
00:58:31,065 --> 00:58:32,825
- [Tom Sirvo] Thanks a
lot, now I'm an orphan.

1695
00:58:32,825 --> 00:58:34,330
- Dad!

1696
00:58:34,330 --> 00:58:36,073
- [Tom Sirvo] Oh not
to worry, that was me.

1697
00:58:36,073 --> 00:58:37,691
I did that.

1698
00:58:37,691 --> 00:58:40,315
You mean you didn't want that done?

1699
00:58:40,315 --> 00:58:43,636
(somber orchestral music)

1700
00:58:43,636 --> 00:58:45,500
- [Croooow] Man, what a huge ear!

1701
00:58:45,500 --> 00:58:47,074
Look at that thing!

1702
00:58:47,074 --> 00:58:48,481
- [Tom Sirvo] Now you
apologize to your daughter,

1703
00:58:48,481 --> 00:58:51,180
see what you made her do?

1704
00:58:51,180 --> 00:58:55,759
Here dry your tears with
this clue I planted.

1705
00:58:55,759 --> 00:58:59,615
- [Croooow] Oh geez, how
long is she gonna mourn?

1706
00:58:59,615 --> 00:59:00,960
- [Tom Sirvo] It's not
so much that he's dead,

1707
00:59:00,960 --> 00:59:02,417
it's just that I have this headache.

1708
00:59:02,417 --> 00:59:04,088
- I've seen this bandana before.

1709
00:59:04,088 --> 00:59:05,721
It belongs to Duke Barnum.

1710
00:59:05,721 --> 00:59:07,350
- [Tom Sirvo] See the neck sweat?

1711
00:59:07,350 --> 00:59:09,246
- No, no he couldn't.

1712
00:59:09,246 --> 00:59:10,079
- Why not?

1713
00:59:11,243 --> 00:59:12,926
- I was with him.

1714
00:59:12,926 --> 00:59:14,900
I was at the edge of the range with him.

1715
00:59:14,900 --> 00:59:18,825
- After he left you, he
must've circled back here.

1716
00:59:18,825 --> 00:59:20,990
- [Croooow] Come on,
it's my plan, play along.

1717
00:59:20,990 --> 00:59:23,312
- He could've made it back
before you did, couldn't he?

1718
00:59:23,312 --> 00:59:24,594
- [Tom Sirvo] Anyway,
it smells like Anteus,

1719
00:59:24,594 --> 00:59:25,551
that's his scent.

1720
00:59:25,551 --> 00:59:26,668
(mumbles)

1721
00:59:26,668 --> 00:59:27,714
- That settles it.

1722
00:59:27,714 --> 00:59:29,810
I'm going after the sheriff.

1723
00:59:29,810 --> 00:59:31,248
- [Croooow] I better put dad up on blocks

1724
00:59:31,248 --> 00:59:32,991
