1728
00:59:42,206 --> 00:59:43,394
- [Mike] Would you settle down?

1729
00:59:43,394 --> 00:59:44,420
Get outta here.

1730
00:59:44,420 --> 00:59:45,753
- Is this yours?

1731
00:59:46,751 --> 00:59:49,521
- [Tom Sirvo] Oh boy, who'd I kill now?

1732
00:59:49,521 --> 00:59:52,443
- Yeah thanks, I must've
dropped it somewhere.

1733
00:59:52,443 --> 00:59:54,365
- Over at the Double C maybe?

1734
00:59:54,365 --> 00:59:55,698
