01:09:41,218 --> 01:09:42,662
Nobody evil? Gypsy?

2007
01:09:42,662 --> 01:09:43,558
- Not evil.

2008
01:09:43,558 --> 01:09:45,214
- I'm still not convinced it happened.

2009
01:09:45,214 --> 01:09:47,081
- Perhaps it ended on potato,

2010
01:09:47,081 --> 01:09:48,923
