2011
01:09:48,923 --> 01:09:50,697
- Fine Scrooge, let's check on the mads.

2012
01:09:50,697 --> 01:09:51,872
- Okay.

2013
01:09:51,872 --> 01:09:53,497
(groans out)

2014
01:09:53,497 --> 01:09:55,653
- I feel so strange, it's as if

2015
01:09:55,653 --> 01:09:58,777
all my intestines cried out at once

2016
01:09:58,777 --> 01:10:01,337
