2017
01:10:01,337 --> 01:10:03,397
Oh, but Frank! Look!

2018
01:10:03,397 --> 01:10:05,682
Someone left us an agony booth.

2019
01:10:05,682 --> 01:10:06,624
- Me first!

2020
01:10:06,624 --> 01:10:07,724
- Race ya!

2021
01:10:07,724 --> 01:10:11,059
- [Frank] Let me in there, get!

2022
01:10:11,059 --> 01:10:13,976
(upbeat pop music)

2023
01:10:19,488 --> 01:10:21,423
- [Mike] Now I for one
am glad you're back.

2024
01:10:21,423 --> 01:10:22,741
- [Tom Sirvo] Me too.

2025
01:10:22,741 --> 01:10:24,052
Wonder what's happened?

2026
01:10:24,052 --> 01:10:27,552
(somber orchestral music)

2027
01:10:31,221 --> 01:10:32,463
- [Croooow] She didn't have someone

2028
01:10:32,463 --> 01:10:34,993
haul away dad I suppose.

2029
01:10:34,993 --> 01:10:38,267
Hey it's the guy who
killed dad, yoohoo, yoohoo!

2030
01:10:38,267 --> 01:10:40,934
(ominous music)

2031
01:10:43,778 --> 01:10:45,028
Oh mother blob!

2032
01:10:48,217 --> 01:10:49,903
- [Tom Sirvo] Oh you got
some of my tapes I think,

2033
01:10:49,903 --> 01:10:52,348
yeah I think you got (mumbles).

2034
01:10:52,348 --> 01:10:53,970
(gun shot fires)

2035
01:10:53,970 --> 01:10:55,570
- [Croooow] We got a domestic in progress

2036
01:10:55,570 --> 01:10:58,030
