2037
01:10:58,030 --> 01:10:59,756
I love you!

2038
01:10:59,756 --> 01:11:01,067
(gun shot fires)

2039
01:11:01,067 --> 01:11:02,831
What is it about you?

2040
01:11:02,831 --> 01:11:04,119
(gun shot fires)

2041
01:11:04,119 --> 01:11:07,211
I don't need an answer right away.

2042
01:11:07,211 --> 01:11:10,614
Her bullets say no, but
her eyes say come hither.

2043
01:11:10,614 --> 01:11:13,437
- [Mike] Strange courting
practices of the old west.

2044
01:11:13,437 --> 01:11:14,523
- [Tom Sirvo] Shut up.

2045
01:11:14,523 --> 01:11:17,932
- [Croooow] So I can't use your bathroom?

2046
01:11:17,932 --> 01:11:19,282
- Jane!

2047
01:11:19,282 --> 01:11:20,365
It's me Duke!

2048
01:11:21,339 --> 01:11:22,491
- I know that.

2049
01:11:22,491 --> 01:11:23,455
- [Croooow] Oh!

2050
01:11:23,455 --> 01:11:25,247
- Stand where you are and drop your gun.

2051
01:11:25,247 --> 01:11:26,080
- But Jane, I...

2052
01:11:26,080 --> 01:11:27,353
(gun shot fires)

2053
01:11:27,353 --> 01:11:28,779
- [Croooow] Oh women.

2054
01:11:28,779 --> 01:11:32,817
(sorrowful orchestral music)

2055
01:11:32,817 --> 01:11:35,991
- [Tom Sirvo] Geez I'm having a bad day.

2056
01:11:35,991 --> 01:11:38,864
- [Croooow] Well that's
dating the 90s, the 1890s.

2057
01:11:38,864 --> 01:11:41,226
(laughter erupts)

2058
01:11:41,226 --> 01:11:44,956
It's not fair, she had a bigger gun.

2059
01:11:44,956 --> 01:11:49,123
- [Mike] You know what? I'm
really not that mad at him.

2060
01:11:50,878 --> 01:11:54,856
- [Croooow] Never brides,
always bridesmaids.

2061
01:11:54,856 --> 01:11:57,696
(sweet orchestral music)

2062
01:11:57,696 --> 01:11:59,506
Now he's Log Ogleby.

2063
01:11:59,506 --> 01:12:00,749
(chuckles)

2064
01:12:00,749 --> 01:12:02,630
Log? (mumbles)

2065
01:12:02,630 --> 01:12:07,259
- [Tom Sirvo] Everything's
up to date in Kansas City.

2066
01:12:07,259 --> 01:12:09,376
- Remedy, Duke's not at the cave,

2067
01:12:09,376 --> 01:12:11,189
it didn't look he'd been there either.

2068
01:12:11,189 --> 01:12:13,214
- Probably couldn't find it in the dark.

2069
01:12:13,214 --> 01:12:16,534
I think I'll get some guys
and see what I can find out.

2070
01:12:16,534 --> 01:12:18,855
- [Croooow] You sure this
will make good toilet paper?

2071
01:12:18,855 --> 01:12:21,304
- If you wait 'til my
cake raises, I'll go too.

2072
01:12:21,304 --> 01:12:25,263
- [Tom Sirvo] (mumbles) western style.

2073
01:12:25,263 --> 01:12:26,200
Syd!

2074
01:12:26,200 --> 01:12:27,257
- [All] El Syd!

2075
01:12:27,257 --> 01:12:28,484
- [Tom Sirvo] Syd!

2076
01:12:28,484 --> 01:12:31,901
(sweet orchestral music)

2077
01:12:34,482 --> 01:12:35,847
(mumbles)

2078
01:12:35,847 --> 01:12:37,421
- [Croooow] Go away, nobody likes me.

2079
01:12:37,421 --> 01:12:39,128
Emerald City is closed!

2080
01:12:39,128 --> 01:12:42,451
(ominous music)

2081
01:12:42,451 --> 01:12:44,344
- [Tom Sirvo] He's hiding
in an abandoned stuckies.

2082
01:12:44,344 --> 01:12:45,912
(chuckles)

2083
01:12:45,912 --> 01:12:47,338
- [Mike] This shot's just screaming out

2084
01:12:47,338 --> 01:12:49,760
for a huge grass hopper to appear.

2085
01:12:49,760 --> 01:12:51,152
- [Croooow] Everybody is so stupid,

2086
01:12:51,152 --> 01:12:53,068
he could just go into
town with a fake mustache

2087
01:12:53,068 --> 01:12:55,376
and no one would notice.

2088
01:12:55,376 --> 01:12:57,190
- [Tom Sirvo] Well that's
not my force, I'm not here!

2089
01:12:57,190 --> 01:12:58,789
Go away!

2090
01:12:58,789 --> 01:13:01,976
- [Mike] Lucky, this hideout
sometimes is real crowded.

2091
01:13:01,976 --> 01:13:04,271
- [Croooow] This place is such a mess,

2092
01:13:04,271 --> 01:13:06,854
he should clean up his hideout.

2093
01:13:09,116 --> 01:13:10,667
(mumbles)

2094
01:13:10,667 --> 01:13:12,993
- Oh it's not too bad, just a flesh wound.

2095
01:13:12,993 --> 01:13:13,935
- [Tom Sirvo] Touch it.

2096
01:13:13,935 --> 01:13:16,203
- Oh I'll clean it up,
then I'll go get Remedy.

2097
01:13:16,203 --> 01:13:18,016
Soon as it gets dark,
we'll get you out of here.

2098
01:13:18,016 --> 01:13:19,600
- Well I've been thinking about that.

2099
01:13:19,600 --> 01:13:20,482
- [Tom Sirvo] Go lower!

2100
01:13:20,482 --> 01:13:21,939
- I wanna stay here.

2101
01:13:21,939 --> 01:13:23,045
This is the last place in the world

2102
01:13:23,045 --> 01:13:24,244
they'd think of looking for me.

2103
01:13:24,244 --> 01:13:25,578
♫ Doo lee, doo lee, doo lee ♫

2104
01:13:25,578 --> 01:13:27,921
- [Croooow] He's in here!

2105
01:13:27,921 --> 01:13:28,754
Yuck.

2106
01:13:30,403 --> 01:13:32,689
- Stuff makes me sneeze,
hay fever I guess.

2107
01:13:32,689 --> 01:13:34,704
- Remedy must have a remedy for that,

2108
01:13:34,704 --> 01:13:36,787
I'll bring you some back.

2109
01:13:39,000 --> 01:13:40,452
- [Croooow] Great scene, huh?

2110
01:13:40,452 --> 01:13:42,493
(chuckles)

2111
01:13:42,493 --> 01:13:43,936
- [Mike] Geez, this movie has more scenes

2112
01:13:43,936 --> 01:13:45,328
