2113
01:13:45,328 --> 01:13:47,102
(chuckles)

2114
01:13:47,102 --> 01:13:49,387
- [Tom Sirvo] Oh just doing
a little morning bowl,

2115
01:13:49,387 --> 01:13:50,804
then get to work.

2116
01:13:52,545 --> 01:13:55,378
(inhales sharply)

2117
01:13:56,759 --> 01:13:58,520
- [Croooow] No, you can't have any,

2118
01:13:58,520 --> 01:14:00,016
this is $80 an ounce.

2119
01:14:00,016 --> 01:14:01,170
(inhales sharply)

2120
01:14:01,170 --> 01:14:03,981
- [Mike] He should just
put a towel under the door.

2121
01:14:03,981 --> 01:14:05,375
- [Tom Sirvo] So you wanna
walk across the street

2122
01:14:05,375 --> 01:14:07,625
to Fenway and catch a game?

2123
01:14:08,530 --> 01:14:11,788
- Rocky tells me that my
men are no longer deputies.

2124
01:14:11,788 --> 01:14:12,694
- [Croooow] Again?

2125
01:14:12,694 --> 01:14:15,176
- That's right Riley, the
way things have quieted down

2126
01:14:15,176 --> 01:14:17,181
with Double C, you don't need anymore.

2127
01:14:17,181 --> 01:14:18,884
- [Croooow] Nice to back your own,

2128
01:14:18,884 --> 01:14:20,426
is that field and stream?

2129
01:14:20,426 --> 01:14:23,010
- What about Duke Barnum?

2130
01:14:23,010 --> 01:14:26,383
- Oh we can handle him when we catch him.

2131
01:14:26,383 --> 01:14:29,226
- I take it my boys could help you out.

2132
01:14:29,226 --> 01:14:31,708
- [Tom Sirvo] Would you stop
touching yourself there?

2133
01:14:31,708 --> 01:14:32,915
- Riley?

2134
01:14:32,915 --> 01:14:34,173
- [Croooow] This could be the start

2135
01:14:34,173 --> 01:14:35,312
