2136
01:14:35,312 --> 01:14:37,270
- Duke Barnum was convicted legally,

2137
01:14:37,270 --> 01:14:40,163
and he's gonna hang legally too,

2138
01:14:40,163 --> 01:14:43,519
but I aim to see that
he's brought in alive.

2139
01:14:43,519 --> 01:14:44,829
- [Tom Sirvo] You pot head.

2140
01:14:44,829 --> 01:14:47,579
Go listen to some big bamboo huh?

2141
01:14:50,425 --> 01:14:52,395
- [Croooow] Oh well,
rotator cuff feels good,

2142
01:14:52,395 --> 01:14:55,590
I think I'll be ready
for my start on Thursday.

2143
01:14:55,590 --> 01:14:57,030
- [Voiceover] It's me again.

2144
01:14:57,030 --> 01:14:58,358
- Who are you yesterday?

2145
01:14:58,358 --> 01:14:59,908
- [Tom Sirvo] I brought
you some swaddling clothes.

2146
01:14:59,908 --> 01:15:01,574
- (mumbles) get off this ranch.

2147
01:15:01,574 --> 01:15:03,653
- [Croooow] And my purse, thank you!

2148
01:15:03,653 --> 01:15:05,796
- [Tom Sirvo] Wanna play some marbles?

2149
01:15:05,796 --> 01:15:08,497
- (mumbles) beginning to
get on my nerves I guess.

2150
01:15:08,497 --> 01:15:12,796
- Oh another day or two and
you'll be as good as new.

2151
01:15:12,796 --> 01:15:14,175
(sneezes forcefully)

2152
01:15:14,175 --> 01:15:15,445
- [Croooow] Oh green sleeves.

2153
01:15:15,445 --> 01:15:16,416
(chuckles)

2154
01:15:16,416 --> 01:15:18,156
- You better bring me
a facial pile of pills.

2155
01:15:18,156 --> 01:15:19,500
- I'll pick 'em up in town tomorrow

2156
01:15:19,500 --> 01:15:21,028
when I go for my mail.

2157
01:15:21,028 --> 01:15:22,984
- What's been going on?

2158
01:15:22,984 --> 01:15:24,477
- Well this Cooper thing sorta put an end

2159
01:15:24,477 --> 01:15:25,765
to all that fighting.

2160
01:15:25,765 --> 01:15:26,961
- [Croooow] The coy remedy.

2161
01:15:26,961 --> 01:15:31,128
- [Tom Sirvo] I just feel that
can't leave a brown mustard.

2162
01:15:32,575 --> 01:15:34,520
- [Croooow] A priest and a rabbi walk...

2163
01:15:34,520 --> 01:15:37,794
- Riley Morgan took
over the Ferguson ranch,

2164
01:15:37,794 --> 01:15:40,811
the Andrews ranch, and three other places.

2165
01:15:40,811 --> 01:15:43,279
- [Croooow] Well you
probably outta get going.

2166
01:15:43,279 --> 01:15:45,990
- You've picked up some notes at the bank.

2167
01:15:45,990 --> 01:15:47,845
- [Croooow] Notes?

2168
01:15:47,845 --> 01:15:49,428
- Dead man's notes.

2169
01:15:50,753 --> 01:15:53,895
- Yeah I know what you mean,
but we ain't got no proof.

2170
01:15:53,895 --> 01:15:55,870
- [Croooow] You ever done it in the hay?

2171
01:15:55,870 --> 01:15:58,037
(mumbles)

2172
01:15:59,914 --> 01:16:02,164
My crotch is suddenly cold.

2173
01:16:05,137 --> 01:16:06,304
(mumbles)

2174
01:16:06,304 --> 01:16:07,185
Okay.

2175
01:16:07,185 --> 01:16:08,599
- How are you Remedy?

2176
01:16:08,599 --> 01:16:10,889
(mumbles)

2177
01:16:10,889 --> 01:16:12,591
This stuff sure (mumbles).

2178
01:16:12,591 --> 01:16:16,016
- [Tom Sirvo] Especially
when you don't deliver it.

2179
01:16:16,016 --> 01:16:18,111
- Oh let me know when
you go to the Double C.

2180
01:16:18,111 --> 01:16:18,944
- Oh why?

2181
01:16:19,846 --> 01:16:22,095
- Drop this letter off for Riley Morgan,

2182
01:16:22,095 --> 01:16:23,654
save me a trip.

2183
01:16:23,654 --> 01:16:24,847
- Sure!

2184
01:16:24,847 --> 01:16:27,683
- [Tom Sirvo] If you don't,
I might become disgruntled.

2185
01:16:27,683 --> 01:16:31,228
♫ Bless this beautiful day ♫

2186
01:16:31,228 --> 01:16:33,042
- [Croooow] It's a
letter, it doesn't rattle.

2187
01:16:33,042 --> 01:16:36,459
(sweet orchestral music)

2188
01:16:37,551 --> 01:16:38,703
- [Tom Sirvo] Let's see here,

2189
01:16:38,703 --> 01:16:40,860
dear sir, your horse has a
potentially serious design flaw

2190
01:16:40,860 --> 01:16:43,017
that could result in explosion and fire.

2191
01:16:43,017 --> 01:16:47,033
(sweet orchestral music)

2192
01:16:47,033 --> 01:16:49,995
- [Croooow] Eh Betty some morphine,

2193
01:16:49,995 --> 01:16:53,828
Jack will have the bike
killed, Casper Doodle.

2194
01:16:54,967 --> 01:16:57,613
- [Tom Sirvo] The US Post
Office, there's still

2195
01:16:57,613 --> 01:17:01,653
no cheaper way to deliver
a blackmail threat.

2196
01:17:01,653 --> 01:17:02,819
- [Mike] Hi it's general delivery,

2197
01:17:02,819 --> 01:17:04,625
one of the great general's
of the Civil War.

2198
01:17:04,625 --> 01:17:05,814
- [Croooow] Ah he's covering the stamp

2199
01:17:05,814 --> 01:17:07,945
so he can't see that
it has Roosevelt on it.

2200
01:17:07,945 --> 01:17:11,715
- [Mike] So I get three free CDs now?

2201
01:17:11,715 --> 01:17:15,900
(horses gallop)
(ominous music)

2202
01:17:15,900 --> 01:17:17,231
- [Tom Sirvo] Oh geez, they should

2203
01:17:17,231 --> 01:17:19,253
call this movie Butterfingers.

2204
01:17:19,253 --> 01:17:20,716
- [Croooow] What is the point?

2205
01:17:20,716 --> 01:17:24,133
(rapid orchestral music)

2206
01:17:27,588 --> 01:17:30,498
Ungodly coincidences of the old west.

2207
01:17:30,498 --> 01:17:32,449
- He dropped something, see what it is.

2208
01:17:32,449 --> 01:17:33,675
- [Croooow] It's a plot device,

2209
01:17:33,675 --> 01:17:35,855
it's very flimsy so be careful.

2210
01:17:35,855 --> 01:17:37,694
(chuckles)

2211
01:17:37,694 --> 01:17:38,877
- Just a couple of letters.

2212
01:17:38,877 --> 01:17:41,500
- [Tom Sirvo] I'll just
read 'em with my feet.

2213
01:17:41,500 --> 01:17:43,956
- Hey this one's for you,
it's from Hank Davis.

2214
01:17:43,956 --> 01:17:45,203
- [Mike] Oh I don't know any Hank Davis,

2215
01:17:45,203 --> 01:17:46,518
let me see that.

2216
01:17:46,518 --> 01:17:48,748
(ominous music)

2217
01:17:48,748 --> 01:17:52,230
- [Croooow] Guilty
Valley, Guilty California.

2218
01:17:52,230 --> 01:17:55,833
(ominous orchestral music)

2219
01:17:55,833 --> 01:17:58,044
- [Mike] Oh shoot, there
was probably gum in here,

2220
01:17:58,044 --> 01:18:00,161
he always sends me some.

2221
01:18:00,161 --> 01:18:01,868
- Come on, I want that letter.

2222
01:18:01,868 --> 01:18:05,746
- [Tom Sirvo] We'll head
him off at exit 31C.

2223
01:18:05,746 --> 01:18:07,621
- [Croooow] (whines) I don't wanna see

2224
01:18:07,621 --> 01:18:09,332
another horse chase!

2225
01:18:09,332 --> 01:18:12,892
(suspenseful orchestral music)

2226
01:18:12,892 --> 01:18:14,988
(imitates gallops musically)

2227
01:18:14,988 --> 01:18:16,233
Stop it!

2228
01:18:16,233 --> 01:18:18,186
I didn't read the letter, go away!

2229
01:18:18,186 --> 01:18:21,433
(suspenseful orchestral music)

2230
01:18:21,433 --> 01:18:25,231
- [Tom Sirvo] That's it,
I'm going to Vodville.

2231
01:18:25,231 --> 01:18:28,981
(imitates gallops musically)

2232
01:18:30,252 --> 01:18:31,903
- [Croooow] Let's see,
what's the stupidest thing

2233
01:18:31,903 --> 01:18:32,820
I could do?

2234
01:18:36,553 --> 01:18:40,470
(suspenseful orchestral music)

2235
01:18:41,402 --> 01:18:44,133
- [Tom Sirvo] Oh he's got one
of them amphibious horses.

2236
01:18:44,133 --> 01:18:47,507
- [Croooow] This is no
place for a gelding.

2237
01:18:47,507 --> 01:18:48,731
- [Mike] Or maybe they're like bees

2238
01:18:48,731 --> 01:18:50,544
and they won't go in the water.

2239
01:18:50,544 --> 01:18:51,733
Sure enough!

2240
01:18:51,733 --> 01:18:54,650
(upbeat pop music)

2241
01:18:58,176 --> 01:18:59,455
- Wait.

2242
01:18:59,455 --> 01:19:00,856
Wait until he gets in the middle,

2243
01:19:00,856 --> 01:19:02,523
it couldn't be fair.

2244
01:19:04,053 --> 01:19:06,136
- [Croooow] I'm on ghoul!

2245
01:19:08,501 --> 01:19:11,255
- [Mike] Watch this, right in the butt.

2246
01:19:11,255 --> 01:19:12,988
(gun shot fires)

2247
01:19:12,988 --> 01:19:14,140
- [Tom Sirvo] Fortunately, Remedy's taken

2248
01:19:14,140 --> 01:19:16,518
a correspondence scuba course.

2249
01:19:16,518 --> 01:19:18,357
- [Croooow] And a little
bit of Jacksonville

2250
01:19:18,357 --> 01:19:19,524
died that day.

2251
01:19:21,066 --> 01:19:22,841
- He was anxious to get somewhere,

2252
01:19:22,841 --> 01:19:25,163
I got a pretty good hunch
