2508
01:28:38,926 --> 01:28:40,256
(laughter erupts)

2509
01:28:40,256 --> 01:28:41,341
It wasn't that funny, was it?

2510
01:28:41,341 --> 01:28:42,421
- No, no sir.

2511
01:28:42,421 --> 01:28:44,212
That's all right, let's read this letter

2512
01:28:44,212 --> 01:28:46,289
that might (mumbles).

2513
