a little something like this.

2523
01:29:08,110 --> 01:29:09,423
♫ Joey the lemur ♫

2524
01:29:09,423 --> 01:29:11,785
(mumbles)

2525
01:29:11,785 --> 01:29:13,653
- Hate to stop ya, hate to stop ya,

2526
01:29:13,653 --> 01:29:14,767
hate like the world to do it,

2527
01:29:14,767 --> 01:29:15,953
we have to read a letter.

2528
01:29:15,953 --> 01:29:17,537
(mumbles)

2529
01:29:17,537 --> 01:29:18,814
Or we get punished or something--

2530
01:29:18,814 --> 01:29:20,269
- Yeah we get punished.

2531
01:29:20,269 --> 01:29:22,064
- So anyway, here it is.

2532
01:29:22,064 --> 01:29:23,890
It's from Joseph A. Hotlzman,

2533
01:29:23,890 --> 01:29:25,915
and we put on Seal Store can I?

2534
01:29:25,915 --> 01:29:27,867
Joseph's from Kailua, Hawaii.

2535
01:29:27,867 --> 01:29:31,617
- Ah, yes in our world,
we also have a Hawaii

2536
01:29:32,838 --> 01:29:34,774
