2546
01:29:59,651 --> 01:30:03,815
your My Mother the Collasal
Colloosta Collasta Calleekie--

2547
01:30:03,815 --> 01:30:05,367
- Yeah I'll bet you let it go.

2548
01:30:05,367 --> 01:30:07,917
Letter concludes by saying, anyway,

2549
01:30:07,917 --> 01:30:09,317
keep up the riffs--

2550
01:30:09,317 --> 01:30:10,559
- Ah yes!

2551
01:30:10,559 --> 01:30:13,347
In our world, we too have riffs.

2552
01:30:13,347 --> 01:30:15,762
We listen to many forms of popular music

2553
